{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261030%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E6%A1%88%EF%BD%9C%E9%84%BA%E7%90%83%E6%94%B9%E8%AA%8D%E3%80%8C%E9%98%BB%E6%AD%A2%E5%90%88%E6%B3%95%E5%9F%8B%E8%91%AC%E5%B1%8D%E9%AB%94%E3%80%8D%E7%BD%AA-%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E6%99%BA%E3%80%81%E9%84%BA%E6%B8%AF%E5%82%91%E6%97%A9%E5%89%8D%E5%B7%B2%E8%AA%8D%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E6%8E%A7%E7%BD%AA-819x1024.png\" width=\"819\"/></figure>\n<p><strong><strong>蔡天鳳遇害案，蔡前夫鄺港智、前家翁鄺球及前大伯鄺港傑否認謀殺罪受審，就3人面對的「阻止合法埋葬屍體」罪，鄺港智、鄺港傑早前已認罪，鄺球原否認此罪，案件今（30日）在高等法院續審時，他改為認罪</strong>。<a href=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/?s=HCCC198%2F2025\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【蔡天鳳案報道結集】</a></strong></p>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>在陪審團席前，法庭書記今以英文讀出控罪，傳譯員再以中文讀出控罪，並詢問鄺球就「阻止合法埋葬屍體」罪的答辯，鄺球大聲回答：「認罪。」<br/><br/><strong><a href=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/?s=HCCC198%2F2025\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">【蔡天鳳案報道結集】</a></strong></p>\n<p>法院：高等法院<br/>法官：暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>被告：鄺港智、鄺港傑、鄺球<br/>控罪：謀殺、阻止合法埋葬屍體<br/><br/>法律代表：<br/>控方：外聘資深大律師Charlotte Draycott郭莎樂、高級助理刑事檢控專員梁育珩、高級檢控官林曉敏、檢控官尹培軒<br/>鄺港傑：大律師Trevor Beel<br/>鄺球：大律師Oliver Davies戴偉奧<br/>鄺港智：大律師Andrew Raffell安華暉<br/>案件編號：HCCC198/2025</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T03:00:02.731151+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":417,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:34:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T04:38:22.594910+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T02:57:01.187343+00:00","content_hash":"1e72f62fad884fcda749a2723de7a1fbadcc2ee08d2a358636670d823ab9275c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}